  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Addressing Image Failures**\n\nI\'ve hit a snag: the image generation function returned a quota error. Following the \"Zero-Broken-Image Policy\" outlined in the frontend design guidelines, I will apply a styled fallback.\n\n\n**Implementing SVG Fallbacks**\n\nI\'ve decided to move away from path guessing or retries and focus on a robust fallback strategy. Now, I\'m generating high-resolution, procedural SVG data-URIs directly within the TypeScript assets module. This ensures every default image is a crisp vector that renders flawlessly across browsers and PDF exports. We\'ll also allow user uploads and a curated vector library. My plan is for a clean, English-only interface.\n\n\n**Designing Page Controls**\n\nI\'m now focused on the page management system. I\'m visualizing a left sidebar with page thumbnails and control buttons for adding, reordering, duplicating, and deleting pages. The interface will feature a quick view toggle between a single-page canvas and a spread/grid overview for visual reordering. I\'m committed to ensuring left-aligned typography as the default and plan to incorporate full alignment controls.\n\n\n**Defining Layout Strategies**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the core layout modules for the new design platform. I\'m focusing on five key strategies: Editorial Split with narrative and visual, Visual Showcase for artwork, Dual Plate Comparison for analysis, Case Study Narrative for multi-column content, and Statement & Biography for portraits. I\'m thinking of building in specific text formatting toolbars.\n\n\n**Developing Text Controls**\n\nI\'ve scoped out the initial text controls. I\'ll include a font family selector with live previews across categories, as well as size and weight adjustments. I\'m building out options for style and decoration, text alignment, and line/letter spacing. A text color picker, with swatches and custom hex input, is also on my list. Finally, I\'ll add rich formatting with bullets, numbered lists, dividers, and a clear formatting option.\n\n\n**Defining Image Controls**\n\nI\'m now outlining image adjustment options. I\'m adding an aspect ratio / height slider, object fit controls, and scaling tools. I\'ll include filter toggles for grayscale, sepia, and high contrast. Further, I\'ll allow corner radius, a border frame, and a caption text editor.\n\n**Developing Global Format**\n\nNow, I\'m defining global formatting and document setup. I\'ve designed several page size and orientation presets, including A4 and US Letter in both portrait and landscape, plus a 16:9 presentation deck. I am building out global theme and paper stock options, with preset color palettes. Finally, I\'ll include global typography pairings and page margin settings.\n\n\n**Implementing Export Features**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the export functionality. I\'m building a dedicated PDF export modal with resolution options: Print Master, Studio High-Res, and Web Portfolio. A real-time rendering progress indicator is also in place, using html-to-image and jsPDF for precise page dimensions. Additionally, I\'m including both rasterized downloadable PDF and a vector print option for maximum flexibility, as well as JSON Save/Load.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_200862"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Set application name and description in metadata.json\",\"EndLine\":6,\"Instruction\":\"Update name and description in metadata.json for FolioPress PDF Portfolio Builder\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"FolioPress \342\200\224 PDF Portfolio Builder\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"A professional page-by-page editorial portfolio builder and high-resolution PDF generator with curated English typography, modular page layouts, and global document styling.\\\",\\n  \\\"requestFramePermissions\\\": [],\\n  \\\"majorCapabilities\\\": [\\\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\\\"]\\n}\",\"StartLine\":1,\"TargetContent\":\"{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"requestFramePermissions\\\": [],\\n  \\\"majorCapabilities\\\": [\\\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\\\"]\\n}\",\"TargetFile\":\"/metadata.json\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating metadata.json\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update metadata.json with app title and description\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "replace_file_content"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_201137"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Load curated Google Fonts for English typography and update HTML metadata in index.html\",\"EndLine\":18,\"Instruction\":\"Update title, meta tags, and add Google Fonts stylesheet in index.html\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>FolioPress \342\200\224 PDF Portfolio Builder</title>\\n    <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"A professional page-by-page editorial portfolio builder and high-resolution PDF generator with curated English typography, modular page layouts, and global document styling.\\\" />\\n    <meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"FolioPress \342\200\224 PDF Portfolio Builder\\\" />\\n    <meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"A professional page-by-page editorial portfolio builder and high-resolution PDF generator with curated English typography, modular page layouts, and global document styling.\\\" />\\n    <meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"website\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" />\\n    <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\\\" />\\n    <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin />\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Bodoni+Moda:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..96,400;0,6..96,600;0,6..96,700;1,6..96,400&family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,300;12..96,400;12..96,500;12..96,600;12..96,700&family=Cinzel:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;0,9..40,700;1,9..40,400&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,400;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=JetBrains+Mono:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Libre+Baskerville:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n  </head>\\n  <body class=\\\"bg-[#F4F4F2] text-[#141413] antialiased selection:bg-[#2563EB]/15 selection:text-[#2563EB]\\\">\\n    <div id=\\\"root\\\"></div>\\n    <script type=\\\"module\\\" src=\\\"/src/main.tsx\\\"></script>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\",\"StartLine\":1,\"TargetContent\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>My Google AI Studio App</title>\\n    <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\\\" />\\n    <meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"My Google AI Studio App\\\" />\\n    <meta property=\\\"og:description\\\" content=\\\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\\\" />\\n    <meta property=\\\"og:type\\\" content=\\\"website\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"twitter:card\\\" content=\\\"summary_large_image\\\" />\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div id=\\\"root\\\"></div>\\n    <script type=\\\"module\\\" src=\\\"/src/main.tsx\\\"></script>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\",\"TargetFile\":\"/index.html\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating index.html with fonts and metadata\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update index.html with English fonts and metadata\"}"
