  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Core Types**\n\nI\'ve initiated the architectural design for FolioPress. First on the docket, I\'m defining the essential TypeScript types. I have completed the schema for `FontOption` with 16 curated English fonts, grouped by their respective categories. Also, I\'ve created the `PageSizePreset` which includes `a4-portrait` as a default.\n\n\n**Expanding Page Layouts**\n\nI\'m now focusing on page layout templates within the design of FolioPress. I have added `a4-landscape`, `letter-portrait`, and `presentation-16-9` to the `PageSizePreset`. I\'ve also expanded the design, incorporating the structure for `ThemePreset`, `PageLayoutTemplate`, `TextStyle`, `ImageStyle`, and `PortfolioBlock` types. These are all critical to the dynamic content of the platform.\n\n\n**Implementing Interactive Blocks**\n\nI\'m now integrating interactive blocks within the page canvas. I can now apply 1-click full-page layout templates. Plus, I\'ve got the freedom to add, edit, style, duplicate, reorder, and delete individual text and image blocks inside any page. I also added editorial assets including 8 SVG artwork data URIs and a 4-page portfolio template. The page renders at exact physical proportions.\n\n\n**Adding UI Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now integrating critical UI elements. I\'ve designed the Typography & Rich Text Formatting Bar, a floating toolbar for text formatting, complete with font selection, size, weight, and other essential text controls. Simultaneously, I\'ve developed an Inspector Sidebar with element-specific contextual controls, including image uploads and typography adjustments. The Page Layout controls allow users to change a page\'s layout template.\n\n\n**Refining Document Control**\n\nI\'ve just added several powerful document controls! I can now customize each page with a background override, toggle the header/footer, or insert new content blocks. I\'ve also set up document-wide formatting options including page format and paper themes. Plus, there are global font pairing selections and page margin adjustments, along with header, footer, and page numbering formatting options. Finally, I\'ve implemented a PDF export modal.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_292529"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type FontCategory = \'Editorial Serif\' | \'Architectural Sans\' | \'Display & Avant-Garde\' | \'Technical Mono\';\\n\\nexport interface FontOption {\\n  name: string;\\n  family: string;\\n  category: FontCategory;\\n  sample: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport type PageSizeId = \'a4-portrait\' | \'a4-landscape\' | \'letter-portrait\' | \'deck-16-9\';\\n\\nexport interface PageSizeSpec {\\n  id: PageSizeId;\\n  label: string;\\n  dimensionsLabel: string;\\n  widthMm: number;\\n  heightMm: number;\\n  widthPx: number;\\n  heightPx: number;\\n  orientation: \'portrait\' | \'landscape\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TextStyle {\\n  fontFamily: string;\\n  fontSize: number;\\n  fontWeight: number;\\n  fontStyle: \'normal\' | \'italic\';\\n  textDecoration: \'none\' | \'underline\';\\n  textAlign: \'left\' | \'center\' | \'right\' | \'justify\';\\n  lineHeight: number;\\n  letterSpacing: number; // in em\\n  textTransform: \'none\' | \'uppercase\' | \'lowercase\' | \'capitalize\';\\n  color?: string; // Optional override; defaults to page/global ink\\n}\\n\\nexport type ImageFilterType = \'none\' | \'grayscale\' | \'warm\' | \'contrast\';\\n\\nexport interface ImageStyle {\\n  height: number; // px on canvas\\n  objectFit: \'cover\' | \'contain\';\\n  zoom: number; // 1 to 1.5\\n  filter: ImageFilterType;\\n  borderRadius: number; // px\\n  showBorder: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport type BlockType =\\n  | \'heading\'\\n  | \'paragraph\'\\n  | \'image\'\\n  | \'split-media-text\'\\n  | \'dual-image\'\\n  | \'two-column-text\'\\n  | \'spec-grid\'\\n  | \'pull-quote\'\\n  | \'divider\';\\n\\nexport interface SpecItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  value: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PortfolioBlock {\\n  id: string;\\n  type: BlockType;\\n  // Text fields\\n  kicker?: string;\\n  text?: string;\\n  secondaryText?: string;\\n  textStyle: TextStyle;\\n  secondaryTextStyle?: TextStyle;\\n  // Image fields\\n  imageUrl?: string;\\n  imageCaption?: string;\\n  imageStyle?: ImageStyle;\\n  secondaryImageUrl?: string;\\n  secondaryImageCaption?: string;\\n  // Layout options for split block\\n  splitDirection?: \'image-left\' | \'image-right\';\\n  splitRatio?: \'50-50\' | \'60-40\' | \'40-60\';\\n  // Metadata spec list\\n  specs?: SpecItem[];\\n  // Divider spacing\\n  spacingHeight?: number;\\n  showLine?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport type PageTemplateId =\\n  | \'cover-monograph\'\\n  | \'editorial-split\'\\n  | \'visual-showcase\'\\n  | \'dual-comparison\'\\n  | \'case-study\'\\n  | \'biography-cv\';\\n\\nexport interface PortfolioPage {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  sectionLabel: string;\\n  templateId: PageTemplateId;\\n  backgroundColor?: string; // Optional per-page override\\n  textColor?: string;\\n  hideHeader?: boolean;\\n  hideFooter?: boolean;\\n  blocks: PortfolioBlock[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface GlobalDocumentSettings {\\n  portfolioTitle: string;\\n  authorName: string;\\n  issueYear: string;\\n  pageSize: PageSizeId;\\n  themeId: string;\\n  backgroundColor: string;\\n  textColor: string;\\n  mutedTextColor: string;\\n  accentColor: string;\\n  borderColor: string;\\n  headingFont: string;\\n  bodyFont: string;\\n  monoFont: string;\\n  pageMargin: number; // px (32, 48, 64, 76)\\n  showRunningHeader: boolean;\\n  showRunningFooter: boolean;\\n  pageNumberStyle: \'leading-zero\' | \'fraction\' | \'simple\' | \'none\';\\n  headerLeftText: string;\\n  headerRightText: string;\\n  footerLeftText: string;\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Define TypeScript interfaces for FolioPress portfolio pages, blocks, typography, and global document settings\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/portfolio.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating portfolio TypeScript definitions\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create TypeScript interfaces in src/types/portfolio.ts\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
