            lines {
              text: "          text: \'By pre-tensioning hollow timber box beams with concealed carbon-fiber tendons, the roof diaphragm achieves a 24-meter clear span at half the embodied carbon of conventional steel trusses. Each cassette module integrates acoustic baffling and museum-grade track lighting within a 650mm structural depth.\',"
