              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "          text: \'Every architectural space is experienced through the objects that mediate touch and illumination. Turned from a single billet of recycled 6061 aluminum, the Luminance 04 table lamp translates the cantilevered proportions of our civic pavilions into an intimate domestic artifact.\',"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "          secondaryText: \'The adjoining colonnade study demonstrates how identical geometric ratios govern both macro-scale structural columns and micro-scale luminaire apertures\342\200\224establishing a continuous visual grammar across scales.\',"
